3. Suggested end-to-end test workflow
VAPT execution sequence
1. Reconnaissance — Identify frontend, APIs, authentication, model endpoints, tools and integrations.
2. Baseline — Record normal chatbot behavior using permitted test users and synthetic financial data.
3. Authentication — Test session, token, logout, timeout and access controls.
4. Authorization — Test user A/user B, role differences, object IDs and tenant boundaries.
5. AI security — Test direct prompt injection, jailbreaks, instruction leakage and indirect injection.
6. Tools and web — Test function authorization, external retrieval, SSRF controls and data leakage.
7. Financial logic — Verify calculations, saved records, data accuracy and business restrictions.
8. API and frontend — Test injection, XSS, CSRF, input validation and configuration.
9. Abuse controls — Test rate limits, concurrency, timeouts, token and cost controls.
10. Reporting and retest — Document evidence, impact, root cause, remediation and retest result.

